OL,3,GNEWSASwinney criticises UK move to ban
OL,4,Anew North Sea drilling
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney says he
OL,7,Fdoes not support the UK government's
OL,8,Fplans to ban any new exploration for
OL,9,Foil and gas in the North Sea.
OL,11,FThe SNP leader told MSPs fossil fuels
OL,12,Fwould be required "for some years to
OL,13,Fcome".
OL,15,FHe argued there was a "rational" case
OL,16,Ffor further exploration if the
OL,17,Fproject's carbon emissions was lower
OL,18,Fthan using imported fuel.
OL,20,FThe Scottish government, in its 2023
OL,21,Fenergy strategy, set out a presumption
OL,22,Fagainst new oil and gas drilling.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
